  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "工程設計法",
    "sub_ename": "ENGINEERING DESIGN METHOD",
    "describe_ch": "設計比較精確的定義是將一些新的東西組合起來，或將已有的東西做新的組合，也可視為給\r\n未被解決的問題提供解決的方法，或對雖已被解決的問題提供新的解決方法的一種過程。本課程從機械設計工程師的角度出發，來對於達成產品功能的形體結構、材料已及在力學上要如何滿足的問題加以論述，但同時也藉由案例來搭配一些創意性的思考方法，由設計需求、問題定義至設計概念與檢討評估之推演步驟，讓學生透過本課程的引導及訓練，得到有創意的設計基礎。\r",
    "describe_eh": "The more precisely definition of product design is a combination of some new things, or making a new combination of the existing things. It also can be regarded as a process for a provision of the solution methods of the unsolved technological problems, or of the updated methods of the existing solved problems. The course intends to describe how to meet the design requirements for the new product via the acknowledgements of the pattern structure, materials and dynamics from the viewpoint of mechanical engineer. In the meantime, the idea of creation is also implemented to the product design process by using several well-known case studies. In other words, students can be trained and guided to gain the fundamentals of the creative product design process in addition to the general series\r\nof design requirement, problem definition, conceptual design, review and assessment.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "使學生了解工程設計概念",
      "describe_en": "Let the students understand the basic concepts of creative engineering design"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "使學生了解系統工程可應用的範圍",
      "describe_en": "The students can have the knowledges for the applications and missions of the creative engineering design"
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "從課堂知識的傳授及啟發來使學生具備掌握國際系統工程技術發展趨勢之能力",
      "describe_en": "Via the learning in the class, it can make students pursue and grasp the trend of the international cutting-edge creative engineering design technologies."
    }
  ],
